# Copy to .env and fill in. .env is gitignored and must never be committed.
#
# GitHub personal access token used ONLY for pushing branches and opening PRs
# from this machine. Fine-grained token, scoped to this repository, needing:
#   Contents:      Read and write
#   Pull requests: Read and write
#   Workflows:     Read and write   <- required, the repo contains a workflow file
#
# Do NOT prefix with VITE_. Vite inlines VITE_* variables into the public
# bundle, which would publish your token to every student who loads the site.
#
# This is NOT the /admin progress token — that one lives only in your browser's
# localStorage and is never stored in this repo in any form.
GH_TOKEN=
